In the Geometry Selections view the selections are transferred as lists of numpy arrays (coordinates) or as spatial data with the Python packages shapely and geopandas (polygons, lines or points, optionally with the columns of a selected pandas DataFrame). The projection of a georeferenced file is read with rasterio. 
