\begin_layout Standard
In the text field of the Control tab coordinates (latitude, longitude) can be entered to fly to a location (
\series bold
Set
\series default
). The coordinates of the current view can be stored in the list of locations (
\series bold
Add
\series default
) and visited again with a double-click on a list entry, e.g., for a presentation in the fullscreen mode. Selected locations can be deleted (
\series bold
Delete
\series default
), the list can be saved and loaded as a *.txt file (
\series bold
Save
\series default
, 
\series bold
Load
\series default
). 
\series bold
Clear Cache
\series default
 deletes the downloaded images and elevations (the tiles of the layers), 
\series bold
Open Cache
\series default
 opens the location of the cache.
\end_layout

