\begin_layout Standard
The Table view is a spreadsheet in which data can be imported, exported, edited and transferred to and from R and Python. Several sheets can be opened side by side (the tabs at the bottom of the view). The columns are titled A, B, C ... (like in LibreOffice), the rows are numbered. A selection (also several ranges with Ctrl/Cmd or Shift) is highlighted with the accent color of the theme; a click on a column or row header selects the whole column or row. Every sheet has its own undo and redo history.
\end_layout

