\begin_layout Subsection
Running Python Scripts
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
A Python script opened in the editor is executed with 
\series bold
Interpret Python
\series default
 in the toolbar of the editor (Ctrl+Alt+Shift+P): the file is saved and executed in the embedded Python. Scripts which run longer than half a second are displayed as a job (
\series bold
Python: <name>
\series default
) in the status line and in the Progress view with the running time and a stop button which interrupts Python. Long computations can report their progress:
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset listings
lstparams "basicstyle={\ttfamily\small},breaklines=true"
inline false
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
\begin_inset Caption Standard

\begin_layout Plain Layout
Progress of a Python script in Bio7 (a job with a progress bar)
\end_layout

\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Plain Layout
import bio7
\end_layout

\begin_layout Plain Layout
for i in range(100):
\end_layout

\begin_layout Plain Layout
    bio7.progress(i + 1, 100, "Computing")      # progress of the job
\end_layout

\begin_layout Plain Layout
with bio7.task("Analysis", total=10) as t:      # an own job
\end_layout

\begin_layout Plain Layout
    for k in range(10):
\end_layout

\begin_layout Plain Layout
        t.update()
\end_layout

\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Progress bars of tqdm are displayed as Bio7 jobs, too. In R, 
\family typewriter
bio7_progress(done, total, text)
\family default
 shows the same job (its stop button interrupts R) and 
\family typewriter
bio7_progress_end()
\family default
 ends it; 
\family typewriter
t <- bio7_task("Analysis", total = 10)
\family default
 is a task with a job of its own (
\family typewriter
t$update()
\family default
, 
\family typewriter
t$done()
\family default
). The examples Bio7_API/22_Progress_and_Jobs.py (Bio7_Python_Examples) and Bio7_API/08_Progress_and_Jobs.R (Bio7_R_Examples) show them.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Subsection
The bio7 Module
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The module 
\family typewriter
bio7
\family default
 connects Python with Bio7:
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\family typewriter
bio7.image(title=None)
\family default
: the active (or the named) ImageJ image as a numpy array.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\family typewriter
bio7.show_image(array, title, display_range)
\family default
: displays an array as a new ImageJ image.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\family typewriter
bio7.update_image(array, title, display_range)
\family default
: replaces the pixels of an opened image (e.g., for a video or a live view).
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\family typewriter
bio7.results_table()
\family default
: the ImageJ results table as a pandas DataFrame.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\family typewriter
bio7.roi()
\family default
: the x and y coordinates of the current selection.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\family typewriter
bio7.ij_macro(code, arg)
\family default
, 
\family typewriter
bio7.ij_macro_file(path, arg)
\family default
 and 
\family typewriter
bio7.ij_run(command, options)
\family default
: run ImageJ macros and commands.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\family typewriter
bio7.r(code)
\family default
, 
\family typewriter
bio7.from_r(name)
\family default
 and 
\family typewriter
bio7.to_r(name, value)
\family default
: evaluate R code and transfer data from and to R.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\family typewriter
bio7.show_html(obj)
\family default
: displays a chart or HTML in the Browser view.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\family typewriter
bio7.progress(done, total, text)
\family default
 and 
\family typewriter
bio7.task(text, ...)
\family default
: the progress of a computation (see above).
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\family typewriter
bio7.java
\family default
: the Java API of Bio7, ImageJ and the Java libraries, e.g., 
\family typewriter
bio7.java.ij.IJ.getImage()
\family default
.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\family typewriter
bio7.call(function, *args)
\family default
: calls a Java function registered in Bio7.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
\begin_inset listings
lstparams "basicstyle={\ttfamily\small},breaklines=true"
inline false
status open

\begin_layout Plain Layout
\begin_inset Caption Standard

\begin_layout Plain Layout
An ImageJ image as a numpy array, filtered and displayed again
\end_layout

\end_inset


\end_layout

