\series default
 with the Update Manager of Bio7 from the update site https://download.eclipse.org/wildwebdeveloper/releases/latest/ (see 
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "chap:Update-Manager"
plural "false"
caps "false"
noprefix "false"
nolink "false"

